        "correct": "5: a saddle at row 1, column 1.",
        "generic": "Not quite right. Check row minima and column maxima first.",
        "byKey": {
          "formula": "You used the mixing formula, which gives −1 here. It does not apply, because the game has a saddle.",
          "avg": "You averaged the cells. Ben will not play at random."
        }
      },
      "explain": {
        "text": "Row minima are 5 and 2; column maxima are 5 and 7. The largest minimum equals the smallest maximum, 5, at row 1, column 1. That saddle is the value, with no mixing."
      },
      "pace": 45
